msgid "Update"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Today, we released Quarkus 3.6.3, our third maintenance release for the 3.6 "
"release train."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"3.6.2 had an extremely short lifetime due to a bug caught early by our "
"community (thanks to those who reported the issue!)."
msgstr ""

msgid "This release contains bugfixes and documentation improvements."
msgstr ""

msgid "It should be a safe upgrade for anyone already using 3.6."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"To update to Quarkus 3.6.3, we recommend updating to the latest version of "
"the Quarkus CLI and run:"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"To migrate from 3.5, please refer to https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/"
"wiki/Migration-Guide-3.6[our migration guide]."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"If you are not already using 3.x, please refer to the https://quarkus.io/"
"blog/quarkus-3-0-final-released/[3.0 announcement] for all the details.\n"
"You can also refer to https://quarkus.io/blog/quarkus-3-upgrade/[this blog "
"post] for additional details.\n"
"Once you upgraded to 3.0, also have a look at the https://github.com/"
"quarkusio/quarkus/wiki/Migration-Guide-3.1[3.1], https://github.com/"
"quarkusio/quarkus/wiki/Migration-Guide-3.2[3.2], https://github.com/"
"quarkusio/quarkus/wiki/Migration-Guide-3.2[3.3], https://github.com/"
"quarkusio/quarkus/wiki/Migration-Guide-3.4[3.4], and https://github.com/"
"quarkusio/quarkus/wiki/Migration-Guide-3.5[3.5] migration guides."
msgstr ""

msgid "Full changelog"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"You can get https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/releases/tag/3.6.2[the full "
"changelog of 3.6.2] and https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/releases/tag/3."
"6.3[3.6.3] on GitHub."
msgstr ""

msgid "Come Join Us"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"We value your feedback a lot so please report bugs, ask for improvements... "
"Let's build something great together!"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"If you are a Quarkus user or just curious, don't be shy and join our "
"welcoming community:"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"provide feedback on https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/issues[GitHub];"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"craft some code and https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/pulls[push a PR];"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"discuss with us on https://quarkusio.zulipchat.com/[Zulip] and on the https:/"
"/groups.google.com/d/forum/quarkus-dev[mailing list];"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"ask your questions on https://stackoverflow.com/questions/tagged/"
"quarkus[Stack Overflow]."
msgstr ""
